{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32010","headline":"送饶州张使君 · 贾岛","name":"送饶州张使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终南云雨连城阙，去路西江白浪头。\n滁上郡斋离昨日，鄱阳农事劝今秋。\n道心生向前朝寺，文思来因静夜楼。\n借问泊帆干谒者，谁人曾听峡猨愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}